        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1819",
          "body_paragraph": 3,
          "quote": "So much I know only by hearsay— the following is of my own knowledge",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[2]/p[3]",
          "source_html_sha256": "38e3c10ac0294fa0468dc4d171ae30c9ae0c325496c81ac6bf218a998563f508",
          "char_start": 328,
          "char_end": 396
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1819",
          "body_paragraph": 4,
          "quote": "went out after this herd but could not find them, however they were perfectly well known to all the people thereabouts and the account I received was as follows—",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[2]/p[4]",
          "source_html_sha256": "38e3c10ac0294fa0468dc4d171ae30c9ae0c325496c81ac6bf218a998563f508",
          "char_start": 37,
          "char_end": 198
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1819",
          "body_paragraph": 5,
          "quote": "wild cattle were 7 in number",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[2]/p[5]",
          "source_html_sha256": "38e3c10ac0294fa0468dc4d171ae30c9ae0c325496c81ac6bf218a998563f508",
          "char_start": 641,
          "char_end": 669
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1819",
          "body_paragraph": 6,
          "quote": "I heard afterwards that the whole race was exterminated by Kennedy",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[2]/p[6]",
          "source_html_sha256": "38e3c10ac0294fa0468dc4d171ae30c9ae0c325496c81ac6bf218a998563f508",
          "char_start": 0,
          "char_end": 66
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1819",
          "body_paragraph": 7,
          "quote": "I have heard from Jerden of another breed of wild cattle living in the salt water lagoons and islands above Nellore",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[2]/p[7]",
